far, with the level drain resistance and automatic searching).  But I
don't really have any experience here... and since I've completed the
quest and have Excalibur, I don't want to waste a wish on something
that might fail if there's a better alternative out there.

Also, should I burn a wish on scrolls of charging or just write them
since I've got magic markers?  I assume that writing them is
preferable to burning a wish.

